{"version":1,"content":"<p>《第61屆節目類金鐘獎頒獎典禮》於昨日（25日）台北舉行，星光大道上眾女星爭妍鬥麗，場面璀璨迷人。</p><p>其中，隨入圍節目《星廚之戰》團隊一同登場的王陽明老婆蔡詩芸無疑成為全場矚目的焦點，憑藉極具張力且優雅性感的裝扮吸睛無數。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:20:37.654635+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T05:47:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T06:18:02.793818+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:18:02.793818+00:00","content_hash":"26876ca2e2d84823848ee027ef889fcf777c9d2061dd263b2ef2ca6cd0aeebaf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}